{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b0fbda6e0f98f9ef5f6022aa7af94e25b829e396d8addd031b6af36835b78d02", "ja": "情熱のおかえし", "zh": "热情的回礼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "723dd6fb20ae1be23f26cbaddaee5d040d54dc3872b0a9198c1867776497f961", "ja": "フラメンコが多くの人を魅了し、公演は大成\n功。打ち上げに来たスペイン料理店で、店主\n夫妻から熱烈な歓迎を受ける。お返しに4人\nは再びフラメンコを披露する事になり、舞台\nへと駆けていくのだった！", "zh": "弗拉门戈吸引了众多观众，演出大获成功。来到庆功宴的西班牙料理店后，受到店主夫妇的热烈欢迎。作为回礼，4人决定再次表演弗拉门戈，向舞台奔去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5570c8dd46d0008e37a6695b96abda2fd2efe17df8b0b58738e0a317a4ef3711", "ja": "（『chicAAmor』公演は満員御礼！　4人の新たな\n境地を見たと各種メディアからも大々的に評価された）", "zh": "（《chicAAmor》公演座无虚席！各大媒体也纷纷盛赞，称看到了4人所抵达的新境界）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d4ce756663002bf8f9682a22d86dae1d1a3a8c1258787d6effb391e62ab2cb2e", "ja": "（終演後も情熱の炎は収まる気配を見せないが……\n今日は打ち上げだ。楽しんでもらおう）", "zh": "（演出结束后，热情的火焰依然没有丝毫熄灭的迹象……不过今天是庆功宴。就让大家好好享受吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "892cbaac13ebc33f41330c6b110be7196458c9b8737d68b78c104f3cda20baa8", "ja": "やっぱりこのお店、ワインもお料理もおいしい～♪\n今回の打ち上げならここしかないよね♪", "zh": "果然还是这家店，葡萄酒和菜都好好吃～♪  \n这次的庆功宴，果然非这里不可呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "af794b1952b46f0d314ed43ba2c0aac3514b1c2ba7f17fcbf903afc79dff8ae8", "ja": "はい！　最初はどうすればいいかわからなくて、\n迷っちゃいましたけど……きっかけをくれました！", "zh": "是的！一开始我都不知道该怎么办，有些不知所措……但您给了我一个契机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "c37ab471b443d99ce89641c2739daddaa83057d888d8bc6d6b4ffc79d3995897", "ja": "ああ。どうなることかと思ったけど……\nま、だいたいのところは、わかった感じだよな！", "zh": "啊。我还以为会变成什么样……不过，感觉大致上算是弄明白了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "9097250ca32a51b0eed741657fbe3e8af15bbe8d96bc29eff67570cc06c54e17", "ja": "異国の文化や精神を通じ、自分の内の情熱を知る……\n貴重な経験でしたわね。", "zh": "通过异国的文化与精神，了解自己内心的热情……\n真是一次宝贵的经历呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1006_youkinatensyu", "source_sha256": "23182cd4bd9fa0de88a794bb489d3c3be5dc5676a83d4e9960df2e4b680c7b2d", "ja": "セニョリータ・アイドルタチ！　ステージ、ミタヨー！\nサイコーノフラメンコ！　オーレ！　エクセレンテ！", "zh": "偶像小姐们！舞台我看到了哦——！\n最棒的弗拉明戈！欧雷！精彩绝伦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4a40a3dc0fc8b63308af24de4510575150101985c4b15fcbbea0b7d217155faf", "ja": "えっ。マスターさんも私達の公演、\n見てくれたんですか！　嬉しい……！", "zh": "咦，主人也来看我们的公演了吗！好开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1008_youkinatsuma2", "source_sha256": "7f1f54a6ee6e824aa3e156745b53d43e5c4bb68860c6ed7541fb630b72ec62cf", "ja": "ワタシモミタヨー！！\nアイドルタチノ、アモール！　ステキネ！！", "zh": "我也看到了——！！\n偶像们的爱！真棒！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f02ca87873cdc68059ce8fef397ec76d6e93ca5eb1540065f1acbfcb507f87d4", "ja": "奥さんも……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "老板娘也……非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "52a9a76a0a22b5defcab7e341568f66b86c579e5d46821bd3b675ee2821346cb", "ja": "本場のフラメンコには、まだ及ばないですけど……。\n私達、やれることを精一杯、やってみました。", "zh": "虽然还比不上正宗的弗拉明戈……但我们已经尽全力，试着做了自己能做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1011_youkinatensyu", "source_sha256": "f65545c4c024bb7562324f3312ce2ff69dc116a083a5cd439105a2d12dec9016", "ja": "オゥ！　チガウチガウ……『ケンソン』イラナイ！\nセニョリータタチ、スゴカッタ！　ジシンモッテ！！", "zh": "哦！不对不对……不需要『谦逊』！\n各位小姐都很厉害！要有自信！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1012_youkinatsuma2", "source_sha256": "2cfa6d54d00d19546d74378981fe6e04e821e3116d102136002faa12d9924874", "ja": "ステージ、トッテモタノシカッタヨ！！\nアリガト！　グラシアス！！　セニョリータ！！", "zh": "舞台表演超级开心！！  \n谢谢！多谢啦！！小姐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b9e69389286f97dde9df84bbd7070c41201b0810eed4e1a9ce9315f355cb6c11", "ja": "あっ……はい！！　グラシアス！！\nこれからも私達、楽しく、情熱で！　頑張りますね！！", "zh": "啊……好的！！谢谢！！\n今后我们也会开心地、充满热情地！继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d74050e0070463115d7b7c8f082ae478fd054ff3ea32008c5a99d6404427c27f", "ja": "良かったな、楽しんでもらえて。紗代子の情熱的な\nダンスは、ファンからも大絶賛だったからな！", "zh": "太好了，能让你享受其中就好。纱代子的热情舞蹈也得到了粉丝们的一致好评！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "f2c91a5a0d298b5f591756ac0af37c58c0e1f000af26357be758f0077377a7f4", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか？　……でも、あとで公演の録画を\n見たら、ちょっと恥ずかしくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？……不过，后来看到演出的录像，感觉有点不好意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9bac47279105ae5316fd841379e535804df5be5178d81598723806f90b70cd50", "ja": "マスターも言ってたけど、自信持っていいよ。今後の\n紗代子はもう少し、セクシー押しでもいいかもな。", "zh": "就像制作人也说的，你可以自信一点。今后的纱代子，或许也可以再突出一点性感风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "5952221d326a7ca63861c83d78dd1c0d145cd0c3eb99615042e9615ce3f39f0a", "ja": "ええっ！？　セクシーって言われるとまだ、その……\n早いかな、って思ったりはしますけど……。", "zh": "诶！？要说性感的话，我还是觉得……现在还早了点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "1a6922c74127c7d5ac7b6a0a9ba48cfbbed784048cd0bc7fa2e88cf2ab1eaeca", "ja": "でも、今回ちょっぴり自信がついたのも本当だから……\nわかりました、たまにチャレンジしてみます！", "zh": "不过，这次确实让我稍微有了点自信……  \n我明白了，我会偶尔挑战一下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e928c1352972b0dfbedb31a3b1c527e19022f0164b3c959372e30d487ee3ccf9", "ja": "……紗代子ちゃん。そうはいっても、もし嫌な時は、\nちゃんと断っていいからね？　いつでも相談してね？", "zh": "……纱代子。话虽这么说，要是不愿意的话，\n好好拒绝也是可以的哦？随时都可以来找我商量哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "022478e90df9d654c1e7f66b0a3f3895ba455a0ea3a51ac494e21b4e4c80b4ef", "ja": "風花さん……ありがとうございます♪\n覚えておきますね！", "zh": "风花小姐……谢谢您♪我会记住的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3710f91de198ffb111fcb75258d8ca00286b42df69bcc364606df569c361c089", "ja": "いっとくけど、あくまでプロデュースの提案で、\nやましい気持ちとかないからな？", "zh": "先说好，这只是制作方面的提议，我可没有什么不正当的想法啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "3a36cde3334d9627660966cd2f039e2a12d98d23ed9945d10cd0b9ecce2211d8", "ja": "ホントかよ……。ま、いいけど。", "zh": "真的假的……算了，随你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "ab7e59dc7f53da5cdfab1b9a57c3fd573601761006e325cdd772a5f95862ca8d", "ja": "ジュリアにもわたくしにも、今後もっと幅広い、\nこれまでにない仕事が入ってくるかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "对茱莉亚和我来说，今后或许会接到范围更广、前所未有的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "683a71f783a6780df7993caba0c0a9cb9b776e74c07db2b0998814ddb76104dd", "ja": "ああ、チャレンジってことなら、なんでも来いだ。\nいまなら何でもできる気もするしな♪", "zh": "啊，要说是挑战，那就尽管来吧。感觉现在好像什么都能做到呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "25b87f82b9d315349036d9cb597bc8b4e8d4ce5de7df02fb889d83634a35c28e", "ja": "例えば……ほら、こちらのような料理店に来ての料理\n番組ですとか。ジュリアにとっては挑戦ではなくて？", "zh": "比如……你看，像这样来到料理店参加烹饪节目之类的。对茱莉亚来说，这不就是挑战了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "5ccbe61be4c4ee5098802398c7f8a6d3cb4fbbc6fa54e7eaae470feb135c2197", "ja": "料理……。そうか、そういうのも来るかもな……。", "zh": "料理……这样啊，说不定也会接到那种工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "044e39133849bd501684b2b2e46a2c7da6fdc499a39cd7ff15bf716bfb386d96", "ja": "なあ千鶴。万が一、不慮の事故で、あたしに\nそういう仕事が来たら……料理を教えてくれないか？", "zh": "喂，千鹤。万一因为意外事故，那种工作找上我了……你能教我做菜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "957828b96bfcec3318190a9092f0b350434d36bc7ee6f5eeb4b95b7ced52396e", "ja": "え、ええ。それは構いませんけれど……\nなんだかすごい気迫ですわね？", "zh": "呃、嗯。这个倒是没问题，不过……总觉得你的气势很不得了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "bb3348a0e743b65de22c2c0394690ea043aab3cce44d58cb87ef67fdf52c92c0", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと人間の食い物を作れる自信がなくて。\nでもセレブ直伝なら、なんとかなりそうだ♪", "zh": "啊，我就是没信心做出人类吃的东西。\n不过要是有名流亲传，感觉就能想办法了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "844dfb78be3982f6026b5b70162654be0887e513c14bb7414eda37f3db6175f3", "ja": "ゲフン！　そ、そうなんですの。\nわかりましたわ。その時は、きっと……！", "zh": "咳咳！是、是这样的呢。明白了。那么到时候，一定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1031_youkinatensyu", "source_sha256": "80b59a9de2ee1bc99138bf4190bb591393c58f1e6dedebcbfdc639ab6c134873", "ja": "ハハハ！　タノシイセニョリータタチニハ、\nワタシカラノ、アモール！　プレゼントシタイネ！！", "zh": "哈哈哈！献给快乐的姑娘们，我要送上来自我的爱之礼！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1032_youkinatsuma2", "source_sha256": "f410409aa88bc34a1cf884cd669c60bb6bbeaf2b5a4d82d351921f3caaba190d", "ja": "カリーニョ！　ノー！　ウワキ、ダメヨ！！\nソレニ、セニョリータタチ、アイドル！！", "zh": "亲爱的！不行！不许花心！！\n\n而且，姑娘们可是偶像！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "985788d23f508abfe16e706a6489614617433dbd381ebed48d5390f1caa23a79", "ja": "ふふっ……ごめんなさい、マスター。\nそうなんです。私達、アイドルなんです。", "zh": "呵呵……对不起，主人。\n是的，我们是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "03cda2d6789ad4da58f2a988276b5f5b855029cfa9405132bf6ff69660b83fee", "ja": "誰かひとりのアモールを受け取るには、まだ早くて。\nもっとみんなに、アモールを届けたいから。", "zh": "现在还不是接受某一个人的爱的时机。因为我想把更多的爱传递给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "77286f0615a75dbb9f66afd7fcba506d73bc4704eb61d8467fc16c3a6853e06f", "ja": "ええ、ですから。\nマスター、お気持ちだけ頂きますわ。", "zh": "嗯，所以说。\n主人，您的心意我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "e81f5a217fa9d9656910d6b671ce30f68096ca48031c0beef7a5a48998eb25c3", "ja": "その代わり、ステージ借りてもいいか？\nアイドルとして、アモールのお返しはしようかなって。", "zh": "不过作为交换，可以借用一下舞台吗？我想，还是以偶像的身份回报这份爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "0c1512f6632057d68245a0a3489ffa6025cd8cf1e5cf8e4ca5d1ad8fb19c9ddf", "ja": "ジュリア……。ふふっ、そうだね、賛成！\nそれじゃ……千鶴さん、風花さんも。行きましょう！", "zh": "茱莉亚……呵呵，没错，我赞成！\n那么……千鹤、风花，我们也走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "def7aaf76283bc5729964737e012bd4415b28199e586403de0c897959b01730c", "ja": "（秘めた変わらぬ衝動を、情熱と燃やして。\nアイドル達は舞台へと駆け上がっていく）", "zh": "（将隐藏于心中、不曾改变的冲动化作热情燃烧。偶像们奔向舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e26d5336756d5afb59aa57cdc633fe20a655a2f8fa285635f9558043a4e545dc", "ja": "（その炎の輝きは、見る人々を夢中にし、翻弄し、\n虜にし続けるだろう……きっと、いつまでも！）", "zh": "（那火焰般的光辉，会让看到的人们沉醉、心神不宁，永远沦为它的俘虏吧……一定，永远如此！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
